msgstr "Wypróbuj publiczny tryb osadzania"

#: admin/class-admin-page.php:208
msgid "Show a widget full-screen, without the site theme — great for a kiosk tablet or iframe. Open any post with a widget and look for \"Public embed\" in the sidebar."
