msgid "WebSend cannot set custom headers, so the token travels in the URL (see the warning under \"Security\" in this plugin's documentation). WebSend also has a length limit (511 characters on most builds) — confirmed on real hardware that a channel token plus this rule fits with plenty of room to spare."
